Package: tradesimr
Title: Backtesting and Paper Trading Framework for Systematic Strategies
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: 
    person(given = "Oliver",
           family = "Lee",
           email = "olee7149@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Author: Oliver Lee
Maintainer: Oliver Lee <olee7149@gmail.com>
Description: 
    A modular framework for backtesting and paper trading algorithmic strategies. 
    The package provides reusable components for simulating trades on historical data 
    and executing strategies in real-time environments with live market data. 
    Supports multi-asset, multi-timeframe workflows, including order simulation, 
    position tracking, risk management, and strategy evaluation. 
    Built for extensibility and integration with external packages such as strategyr
    for signal generation and okxr for exchange data.
Depends: 
